Coded the one row (Kolodin / voting-rights) and wrote it to `labels/coder-2.json`. HB2785 is his prime-sponsored, House-passed bill, but it's a multi-subject elections act (primary dates, identification, canvass, recounts, ballots), and its only ID-related clause makes showing ID with a mailed early ballot optional rather than requiring photo ID in person plus an ID number on every mail ballot — so no rung is chair-shaped without a tying statement from him. Coded BLANK `no-evidence` and flagged the missing statement in `needs_source`.
